{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对人物动机和结尾的独立性表达有所压缩，尤其弱化了“即使一直没有亲近的人，也愿意自己好好过下去”这一重要落点，X的叙事解释更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词加亮、话与感受纵向交替，以及按音乐进程出现的提示，让观众更容易在听音乐时抓住当前重点，也更容易把音色、节奏、情绪变化和人物心理对上。X的优势是人物动机交代得更充分，尤其是为什么怀念、为什么不回去、最后如何安顿自己，前后因果更完整。整体仍选Y，因为边听边扫的场景中，信息出现的时机、重点的可见性以及音乐细节与心理感受的对应，带来的实际体验提升更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "37d6c3f0-e290-4894-bfd1-6ef9efc50ae1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T223801065058Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:38:46.581207+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a339064817a037385be3f3203249dce89b07f5feed6dbef3ac911568982f01c7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat